# Changes to the pipeline, the consumer policy and the tests decide what the
# mirror serves and what its VSA means.
#
# mirror/ has no owner on purpose. GitHub requests a review from the owner on
# every PR that touches an owned path, and Renovate automerges dozens of
# digest refreshes a day, so each one notified the owner. Renovate requests a
# review itself when the checks of a refresh fail (`reviewers` in
# renovate.json5), and the Streams workflow does for the PRs it opens.
/.github/ @curantes
/policy/  @curantes
/tests/   @curantes
